/* Setup */
"Finish setting up Hotspotly" = "完成 Hotspotly 的設定";
"Turning off AWDL on a hotspot needs administrator rights. Hotspotly adds a rule that lets it run only `ifconfig awdl0 up` and `ifconfig awdl0 down`, and nothing else. Keepalive and pinning work without it." = "在熱點上關閉 AWDL 需要管理員權限。Hotspotly 會加入一條規則，只允許它執行 `ifconfig awdl0 up` 和 `ifconfig awdl0 down`，其他什麼都不能做。不設定的話，keepalive 和釘選網路照常能用。";
"Continue" = "繼續";
"Not Now" = "稍後";
"Could not finish setup" = "無法完成設定";
"Could not change the command line tool" = "無法變更命令列工具";

/* Uninstall */
"Uninstall Hotspotly?" = "要解除安裝 Hotspotly 嗎？";
"This removes the administrator rule, the command line tool and the login item, and turns AWDL back on. Then move Hotspotly.app to the Trash." = "這會移除管理員規則、命令列工具和登入項目，並重新打開 AWDL。之後把 Hotspotly.app 丟到垃圾桶就好。";
"Uninstall" = "解除安裝";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Could not uninstall" = "無法解除安裝";

